            "detailed_description": "Join the Band and become an Outlaw!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay as Robin Hood and his Merry Men in this 2D Action Platformer. Help take back England from the diabolical Prince John. Battle your friends in a Local Multiplayer Deathmatch gamemode! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin the Band today, England needs you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n - Play as Robin, Marian, and many more!<br />\r\n - Multiple Towns to take back and Bosses to beat<br />\r\n - Local Multiplayer Deathmatch mode<br />\r\n - Saved Merry Men to populate your Hideout in Sherwood Forest<br />\r\n - Watch the gold you steal accumulate in your Hideout<br />\r\n - Unlock secret characters for use in both Singleplayer and Multiplayer<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*IMPORTANT*<br />\r\n*To play Multiplayer, you need at least 2 Controllers*",
